  {
    initialState: initialStateObject,
    reducers: reducersMap,
    middlewares: [loggerMiddleware],
    enhancers: [applyMiddleware('myMiddleWare')],
  },
  store,          // the store instance (or its name if you prefer a string)
  context,        // the React context object (or its name)
  { useStateSelectorHook, useDispatchActionHook }   // custom hooks for components
);
```

This single line creates the central store, exposes the React context, and bundles the custom hooks so that components can read and dispatch state changes efficiently.

